      "en_US": [
        "Every so often, an Egg will be found\n",
        "at the Pokémon Day Care.\r",
        "And they’re found without anyone\n",
        "knowing how they got there.\r",
        "Is someone leaving them there?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1021_T04R0401_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "They say no one has ever seen\n",
        "a Pokémon actually lay an Egg.\r",
        "So, it hasn’t been proven that\n",
        "Pokémon actually lay Eggs."
      ]
    }
  ]
}